<h3 id=3D"AddingQueuePointsthroughActionBots-GeneralSettings">General Setti=
ngs</h3>
<ol>
<li>
<p>In the Name field enter in a descriptive name such as =E2=80=9CAssign 20=
0 Queue Points to MyQs=E2=80=9D.</p></li>
<li>
<p>In the Description field enter in a description of what this bot is mean=
t to do.<br></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-cente=
r-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedde=
d-image image-center" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"5b66849dbe5c51c=
6821a8f3e339405e52ae4ef0db977a616ad29a83f3a3ba73b" data-image-src=3D"https:=
