ked-resource-container-id=3D"1031536666" data-linked-resource-container-ver=
sion=3D"7" data-media-id=3D"f317dfc3-8843-45b9-bdd2-feae19eb6975" data-medi=
a-type=3D"file" height=3D"67"></span>
<p></p></li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"AddingQueuePointsthroughActionBots-Trigger">Trigger</h3>
<p>The trigger is what initiates the Action bot</p>
<ol>
<li>
<p>In the Trigger Type field select the Event option.</p></li>
<li>
<p>In the Sub Type field select the Queue option.<br></p><span class=3D"con=
fluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" width=3D"468=
" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"fc08d47e4175dd2ec19c6bd14853ef49d0df62934df16e571=
f4efcd411f8748d" data-image-src=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/dow=
nload/attachments/1031536666/dtkXFBDDExGOfwM3qUvvo_af8H9UPfFr0v9wUZTa3bOiZ4=
rFhlnR-JSgpBbeQeyzgyPPPp-MaCu6gEGeyzM9Fu9nHdzQoEmVVGISwpTfsuT3uyYtugQuZz99o=
6Xq4xaQOQ?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1586544533708&amp;cacheVersion=
