urce-default-alias=3D"dtkXFBDDExGOfwM3qUvvo_af8H9UPfFr0v9wUZTa3bOiZ4rFhlnR-=
JSgpBbeQeyzgyPPPp-MaCu6gEGeyzM9Fu9nHdzQoEmVVGISwpTfsuT3uyYtugQuZz99o6Xq4xaQ=
OQ" data-base-url=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-reso=
urce-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"103153=
6666" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"7" data-media-id=3D"66f8d03=
7-b551-4b49-b3a9-16781c3c31f5" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"73"></spa=
n></li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"AddingQueuePointsthroughActionBots-Event">Event</h3>
<p>The event is used to narrow down the interactions that will be impacted =
by the Action bot.&nbsp;In this case we only want to add Queue Points to ce=
rtain Queues and only when an interaction enters the queues.</p>
<ol>
<li>
<p>In the Queues field select the queues you want to be impacted by the Act=
ion bot. In this example, the MyQ for Lydia Stanley has been chosen.</p></l=
i>
<li>
<p>In the Events field select the Enter Q event.<br></p><span class=3D"conf=
luence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper"><img class=3D"confluence=
-embedded-image image-center" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"6793c0e6cd075b857ba56=
b7a32d41c014b5fa89fbabfb632f48f28cebf9e8b48" data-image-src=3D"https://shar=
pencx.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/1031536666/zc5okVdQgBMKS84CyE=
_2VRfVMRmgXcP1lC3t4rblD2Xvpye8pMjX2lR1MuPIancnOMgq7E20u6eBwONoT9rz22UC6cFc8=
z7mMb2uTaYzPTeeRZoDtdnQhVQI4Sl41RUn0w?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D15=
86544591835&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"135" data-wid=
th=3D"1207" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"=
1033109558" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D=
"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"zc5okVdQgBMKS84CyE_2VRfV=
MRmgXcP1lC3t4rblD2Xvpye8pMjX2lR1MuPIancnOMgq7E20u6eBwONoT9rz22UC6cFc8z7mMb2=
